Print the JSON Schema (draft-07) of treerig.toml, for editors to complete and
check it with. It is generated from the same definitions that validate the file,
but it cannot state every check: `treerig config validate` makes the rest. It
needs no treerig.toml.

Usage:
  treerig config schema [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for schema

Global Flags:
      --progress mode   how to show progress: auto (redraw on a terminal) or
                        plain (one line per change) (default "auto")
  -v, --verbose         show what treerig runs, and every detail
